BEGIN_TEXT
Names for the stations you work: a call and the name you know it by,
and collectives that hold several names. A message can be sent to a name
from the book and goes to every call it holds.

Every entry carries its world: MARS or amateur. The message center sends
only to MARS stations. A send to an amateur entry, or to a collective
holding one, is refused with the reason; it is never sent somewhere else
instead.

The book can be written out and read back in as a file, world and all.
END
